{"title":"Pigment","sourceTitle":"Pigment/pt-br","html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"pt-BR\" dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"mw-pt-languages noprint navigation-not-searchable\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"mw-pt-languages-label\">Other languages:</div><ul class=\"mw-pt-languages-list\"><li><a href=\"/Pigment\" class=\"mw-pt-languages-ui mw-pt-progress mw-pt-progress--complete\" title=\"Pigment (100% translated)\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">English</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/Pigment/fr\" class=\"mw-pt-progress mw-pt-progress--high\" title=\"Pigment (88% translated)\" lang=\"fr\" dir=\"ltr\">français</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"mw-pt-languages-selected mw-pt-progress mw-pt-progress--high\" lang=\"pt-BR\" dir=\"ltr\">português do Brasil</span></li>\n<li><a href=\"/Pigment/ru\" class=\"mw-pt-progress mw-pt-progress--low\" title=\"Пигмент (4% translated)\" lang=\"ru\" dir=\"ltr\">русский</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/Pigment/zh\" class=\"mw-pt-progress mw-pt-progress--complete\" title=\"颜料 (100% translated)\" lang=\"zh\" dir=\"ltr\">中文</a></li></ul></div>\n<div class=\"mw-translate-fuzzy\">\n<p><b>Pigmentos</b> são itens que podem ser usados ​​para marcar <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/parchment\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/parchment\">pergaminhos</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Parchment\" title=\"Parchment\"> </a></span>, <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Parchment#Label\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Parchment\">caixas rotuladas</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Parchment#Label\" title=\"Parchment\"> </a></span>, <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/sign\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/sign\">assinares</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Sign\" title=\"Sign\"> </a></span>, <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Sign#Crafting_Component\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Sign\">baús com rótulos</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Sign#Crafting_Component\" title=\"Sign\"> </a></span>, <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Plaque\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Plaque\">placas ornamentais</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Plaque\" title=\"Plaque\"> </a></span> e <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/signpost\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/signpost\">placas de sinalizaçãos</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Signpost\" title=\"Signpost\"> </a></span>. Itens diferentes produzem cores diferentes de pigmento. Eles também podem ser usados ​​para desenhar símbolos nas paredes.\n</p>\n</div>\n<p><span id=\"Usage\"></span>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Uso\">Uso</span></h2>\n<div class=\"mw-translate-fuzzy\">\n<p>Para escrever usando um pigmento, equipe o item e <abbr title=\"Esgueirar-se, o padrão é shift e clicar com o botão direito\">escrever</abbr> com Shift + <span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Right mouse button\" src=\"/images/c/c5/RMB.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"15\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-file-width=\"15\" data-file-height=\"22\" /></span></span> o letreiro/placa com o item. Uma caixa com um campo de texto deve ser aberta, permitindo aos jogadores escrever e editar o texto na placa ou na etiqueta do baú.\nNota: o giz tem tendência a colocar-se no chão em vez de escrever, a menos que algo já esteja a ocupar o espaço em frente ao letreiro/placa.\n</p>\n</div>\n<p>Para desenhar diretamente nas paredes/pisos, equipe giz ou carvão e pressione <style data-mw-deduplicate=\"TemplateStyles:r116235\">.mw-parser-output .keyboard-key{border:1px solid #aaa;border-radius:0.2em;box-shadow:0.1em 0.1em 0.2em rgba(0,0,0,0.1);background-color:#f9f9f9;background-image:linear-gradient(to bottom,#eee,#f9f9f9,#eee);color:#000;padding:0.1em 0.3em;font-family:inherit;font-size:0.85em}.mw-parser-output .nowrap{white-space:nowrap}</style><kbd class=\"keyboard-key nowrap\">F</kbd> para abrir o menu de desenho. <span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Left mouse button\" src=\"/images/0/0a/LMB.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"15\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-file-width=\"15\" data-file-height=\"22\" /></span></span> no símbolo desejado, aponte para a pedra/madeira e <link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r116235\" /><kbd class=\"keyboard-key nowrap\">Ctrl</kbd> + <span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Right mouse button\" src=\"/images/c/c5/RMB.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"15\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-file-width=\"15\" data-file-height=\"22\" /></span></span> para aplicar o símbolo.\n</p><p><span id=\"Types\"></span>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Tipos\">Tipos</span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\">\n<caption>\n</caption>\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>Material\n</th>\n<th>Nome\n</th>\n<th>Pigmento\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/File:Stone-limestone.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"/images/thumb/a/a2/Stone-limestone.png/100px-Stone-limestone.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/a/a2/Stone-limestone.png/150px-Stone-limestone.png 1.5x, /images/thumb/a/a2/Stone-limestone.png/200px-Stone-limestone.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"400\" data-file-height=\"400\" /></a></span>\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Rock\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Rock\">Calcário</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Rock\" title=\"Rock\"> </a></span>\n</td>\n<td>Branco-cal\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/File:Stone-chalk.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"/images/thumb/c/cc/Stone-chalk.png/100px-Stone-chalk.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/c/cc/Stone-chalk.png/150px-Stone-chalk.png 1.5x, /images/thumb/c/cc/Stone-chalk.png/200px-Stone-chalk.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"400\" data-file-height=\"400\" /></a></spa